msgstr ""

#: inc/SiteCheck/Catalogue.php:109
msgid "PHP execution in the uploads folder"
msgstr ""

#: inc/SiteCheck/Catalogue.php:110
msgid "If PHP runs in the uploads folder, one uploaded file is enough to take over the site. It is the most common way an attack escalates."
msgstr ""

