#: inc/SiteCheck/Catalogue.php:116
msgid "Run the check again with the uploads probe ticked."
msgstr ""

#: inc/SiteCheck/Catalogue.php:120
msgid "PHP files in the uploads folder"
msgstr ""

#: inc/SiteCheck/Catalogue.php:121
msgid "The uploads folder should hold media only. A PHP file there is either a plugin's placeholder or something that does not belong, often a backdoor."
msgstr ""

#: inc/SiteCheck/Catalogue.php:122
msgid "Check every PHP file listed and delete what does not belong there."
msgstr ""

#: inc/SiteCheck/Catalogue.php:124
msgid "Start with the files marked as suspicious code: they need a look today."
